<title>UK: Lower UK meals and feeds fail to tempt buyers.</title>
<headline>Lower UK meals and feeds fail to tempt buyers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Easier high protein soymeal prices failed to tempt buyers on the UK meals and feeds market on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;There have been a few odd loads done but nothing worth reporting,&quot; said a trader.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal offers were around three stg down in the nearby positions and one stg lower in the forwards following the easier close in Chicago.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
</text>
